<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Time Machine"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="CHIAKI SATO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TIME LEAP - EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602300136"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1664696515"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>CHIAKI SATO &amp; Hikaru Utada</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">你看 触发回忆的开关其实很简单</text><text for="L2">猛然间 犹如本能般时光倒流</text><text for="L3">采一片花瓣轻抚你的脸庞</text><text for="L4">落下一记永不休止的长吻</text><text for="L5">宛如早已设好的定时发条</text><text for="L6">微小的萌芽正悄然滋长</text><text for="L7">像个傻瓜一样 不论重复多少次</text><text for="L8">依然会深陷于你</text><text for="L9">每当从梦境中醒来 总是无可奈何</text><text for="L10">究竟为何 连缘由都不明了便已泪流满面</text><text for="L11">那些早已淡忘的温柔应和</text><text for="L12">与七星香烟的淡淡余息</text><text for="L13">仿佛又轻轻掠过鼻尖</text><text for="L14">那些被深埋心底的情愫不断翻涌流淌</text><text for="L15">这一定是来自旧日的一场故障</text><text for="L16">请再抱抱我 给我一辈子的拥抱吧</text><text for="L17">当第八声铃音终于响起</text><text for="L18">季节已无可挽回地迎来终局</text><text for="L19">指尖缓缓抚过地上的残影</text><text for="L20">以及那些从未愈合的伤痕</text><text for="L21">往昔两情相悦的走马灯</text><text for="L22">在眼前飞速而纷乱地轮转</text><text for="L23">即便独自守在曾经相约的地点</text><text for="L24">也深知你不会再来</text><text for="L25">胸口这阵刺痛究竟从何而起</text><text for="L26">心脏仿佛正将滚烫的泪水泵向全身</text><text for="L27">等这具浸透了悲伤的身躯</text><text for="L28">风干泪痕之时 再重逢吧</text><text for="L29">若能坐上一台时光机</text><text for="L30">请让我听听你那时真正的心声</text><text for="L31">对你而言 难道至今仍是一场系统故障吗</text><text for="L32">别这样 请不要给我这告别的拥抱</text><text for="L33">困在无论如何也挣不脱的床榻</text><text for="L34">曾与你紧扣的十指</text><text for="L35">在泛着寒意的清晨 又梦见了你</text><text for="L36">那些早已淡忘的温柔应和</text><text for="L37">与七星香烟的淡淡余息</text><text for="L38">仿佛又轻轻掠过鼻尖</text><text for="L39">那些被深埋心底的情愫彻底决堤满溢</text><text for="L40">这一定是来自旧日的一场故障</text><text for="L41">请再抱抱我 给我一辈子的拥抱吧</text><text for="L42">等这具浸透了悲伤的身躯</text><text for="L43">风干泪痕之时 再重逢吧</text><text for="L44">若能坐上一台时光机</text><text for="L45">请让我听听你那时真正的心声</text><text for="L46">对你而言 难道至今仍是一场系统故障吗</text><text for="L47">别这样 请不要给我这告别的拥抱</text></translation></translations><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:22.623" end="0:22.743">ho</span><span begin="0:22.743" end="0:22.893">ra </span><span begin="0:22.893" end="0:23.013">hi</span><span begin="0:23.013" end="0:23.193">ki</span><span begin="0:23.193" end="0:23.583">gane wa </span><span begin="0:23.583" end="0:23.933">tan</span><span begin="0:23.933" end="0:24.263">jun </span><span begin="0:24.263" end="0:24.633">de</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:25.043" end="0:25.153">fu</span><span begin="0:25.153" end="0:25.333">to </span><span begin="0:25.333" end="0:25.473">ji</span><span begin="0:25.473" end="0:25.633">dou</span><span begin="0:25.633" end="0:25.943">teki </span><span begin="0:25.943" end="0:26.053">ni </span><span begin="0:26.053" end="0:26.373">time</span> <span begin="0:26.373" end="0:26.683">goes</span> <span begin="0:26.683" end="0:27.143">back</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="0:27.507" end="0:27.887">kimi o </span><span begin="0:27.887" end="0:28.207">hana</span><span begin="0:28.207" end="0:28.407">bi</span><span begin="0:28.407" end="0:28.527">ra </span><span begin="0:28.527" end="0:28.677">de </span><span begin="0:28.677" end="0:28.807">na</span><span begin="0:28.807" end="0:29.067">zot</span><span begin="0:29.067" end="0:29.427">te</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin